<title>SWEDEN: Sweden state forecaster KI sees short, shallow dip.</title>
<headline>Sweden state forecaster KI sees short, shallow dip.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's state forecasting institute KI said in a quarterly report published on Wednesday that a dip in economic growth would be short and shallow.</p>
</text>
